abstract: >-
  Trilingual research demonstrator for EPS technology evaluation, contextual
  recommendation, pedagogical scenario design and teaching support. The
  application uses documented and unverified real-app entries and heuristic
  matching. The Laboratory provides 32 field instruments, descriptive and
  inferential statistics checked against R (29/29 metrics) and a three-level
  restitution. The application catalogue (2,466 entries) derives from a mapping
  of 45,676 store records. This public implementation is distinct from the
  doctoral prototype evaluated in the associated research; the prototype's
  empirical results do not apply to it. This release does not establish
  empirical educational efficacy, scientific validation of the instruments or
  institutional production readiness.
